luci-app-g7-ddm
Optical diagnostics for the TP-Link XZ000-G7 GPON ONT (galachip OpenWrt firmware).

This product is a modified version of luci-app-hsgq-ddm
  https://github.com/JaGPR/luci-app-hsgq-ddm
which is itself a modified version of luci-app-vsol-ddm
  https://github.com/AliLostInTheDark/luci-app-vsol-ddm
